t-collocation fallback for this bounded A1 use."},{"query":"that way is good","rationale":"Exact target-collocation fallback for this bounded A1 use."}],"noNewGrammarReason":"Lexical/construction focus: way is introduced in a bounded method sense without adding new grammar."},"pedagogyVersion":2},"pilot":false,"audioRequired":true,"humanEnglishAuditRequired":true,"dialogueRuntime":"guided_exchange","qualityStage":"model_reviewed_for_testing"}')
